<title>USA: Carver Q4 shr/loss $0.64 vs profit $0.12.</title>
<headline>Carver Q4 shr/loss $0.64 vs profit $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.64   profit	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,400   profit	   270</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,176		    2,182</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.80   profit	 $0.35</p>
