<p> Avg shrs		   2,169		    2,156</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarter and years ended March 31.</p>
<p>The Q4 includes a $1.6 million provision for loan losses and a $1.0 million charge reflecting the sale of $72 million in money-market securities.</p>
<p>Fiscal 1997 includes a $1.6 million assessment for the recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund, mandated by law.</p>
<p>Full name is Carver Bancorp Inc</p>
